{"title":"Captain Rhazin","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Captain Rhazin is a named <a href=\"#/monster/dune-captain\">Dune Captain</a> seen at level 49.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Captain Rhazin</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 1802, 1064</li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"captain-rhazin\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-head\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b0a1dcb7a8a29c4f1ffd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"shagbark-bow\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6ad40ed0b4459385c272.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shagbark Bow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/b9a61e60c6aa717553b1.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Captain Rhazin</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/dune-captain\">Dune Captain</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>49</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>870</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}